  title: "Mass Rapid Transit (MRT) Proposal \u2013 1960s "
  info: "As Singapore\u2019s population grew, the government proposed the idea of
    a rail-based public transport system to ease road congestion. Studies were conducted
    throughout the 1960s to determine the feasibility of a modern mass transit system,
    laying the groundwork for future developments.  "
